, even if it's a small amount, is good.\r\n\r\nThis change has no real downsides, but if you think that the 10 seconds to review this and a commit in history is too much noise, then I'm fine with this getting closed.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4763059143/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4763084736","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120524#issuecomment-4763084736","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120524","id":4763084736,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABG-bnwA","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-21T19:40:32Z","updated_at":"2026-06-21T19:40:32Z","body":"I don't see this affecting performance in any way, the return value will be ignored if not used I'd say\r\n\r\nBut changes have to be justified not just \"it'd be good\" or similar, the fact that the code wouldn't maybe have had this added originally but that doesn't necessarily mean it's necessary to remove\r\n\r\nI'd suggest focusing on more useful changes","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4763084736/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4763191792","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120524#issuecomment-4763191792","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120524","id":4763191792,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABG-iJ8A","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-21T20:25:20Z","updated_at":"2026-06-21T20:25:20Z","body":"Closing as no tangible problem is addressed here.\r\n\r\n> What's the policy on these kind of changes? Is there some rules or goals that must be met? I simply saw that this function doesn't need to return an Error so I removed it, no deeper meaning. It's not some kind of a massive change that affects a lot of functionality. Like I mentioned, this function is only called once, so the effect is practically zero, but I also don't think that having unnesecary code/memory, even if it's a small amount, is good.\r\n\r\nGenerally we try to avoid code churn that isn't necessary, as it creates unnecessary work for the bugsquad, area maintainers and the release team, and every change (ever so small) can introduce bugs.\r\n\r\nThat being said; we do welcome code cleanup PRs, assuming they accomplish some tangible goal (like improved performance) or meaningfully simplify the code, making it less bug prone (e.g. by being harder to misuse).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4763191792/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4763204577","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120524#issuecomment-4763204577","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120524","id":4763204577,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABG-i74Q","user":{"login":"NoNormalDev","id":190293561,"node_id":"U_kgDOC1emOQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190293561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev","html_url":"https://github.com/NoNormalDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/subscri